msgid "Major"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:17
msgid "Annual"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:18
msgid ""
"New major version (e.g., 9.0 → 10.0). May include breaking changes, "
"architectural updates, and new platform capabilities. Previous Major "
"enters security/maintenance mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:19
msgid "Minor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:20
msgid "Quarterly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:21
msgid ""
"New features and enhancements within the current Major (e.g., 9.0 → 9.1 →"
" 9.2). Backward compatible within the Major."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:22
msgid "Patch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:23
msgid "Monthly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:24
msgid ""
"Bug fixes and security updates (e.g., 9.0.0 → 9.0.1 → 9.0.2). No new "
"features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:26
msgid "**Example annual release timeline:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:28
msgid ""
"9.0.0 → 9.0.1 → 9.0.2 → 9.1.0 → 9.1.1 → 9.1.2 → 9.2.0 → 9.2.1 → 9.2.2 → "
"10.0.0\n"
"├── Q1 ──────────────────┤── Q2 ─────────────────┤── Q3 "
"─────────────────┤── Q4 ──┤"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:34
msgid "Component Release Schedule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:37
msgid "Manager (Morpheus Appliance)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:39
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Manager follows the Major/Minor/Patch cadence described "
"above. All platform features, API changes, and UI updates ship in Manager"
" releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:42
msgid "HVM OS (Hypervisor Host Operating System)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../release_notes/lifecycle.rst:44
msgid ""
"The HVM OS is released **quarterly** alongside each Minor Manager "
"release. It is a purpose-built operating system for HVM hypervisor hosts "
"based on Ubuntu LTS."
msgstr ""

